    46	
    47	### Corrections
    48	
    49	Both findings were corrected in commit `a285204cb83d08b6c6db7cb5e482064768479f54` and covered by the end-to-end regression test. The full audit record is sanitized before append. FlightRecorder classification failure now returns a safe in-memory skip result and does not append that record or throw into capability dispatch.
