+ * helper scripts at `<installed-package>/eval/`, preserving their relative module tree. Datasets,
+ * task oracles, configs, tests, and evidence stay out of the artifact; callers supply a dataset
+ * directory at runtime. Installed `nexus eval` resolves this module from the package root and
+ * imports `runVersionedEvaluation`; compiling only `cli/src` does not produce a usable evaluator.
